  triage:title "PeerTransportRuntime::persist_replay_request is #[cfg(test)]-only but sprint-W4.md lists as production path" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/peer_transport.rs:618-628: PeerTransportRuntime::persist_replay_request is #[cfg(test)]-only. Sprint-W4.md:130-132 lists it as a targeted production path. Production replay persistence runs through PeerClientTransport::persist_replay_request (non-test, lines 249-280) which works correctly, but the sprint doc is misleading. Fix: either expose the method as non-test with production delegation, or update sprint-W4.md to clarify this is test-only scaffolding and production path is PeerClientTransport::send." ;
